-- Stage 1 (Years 1-2) two-year program: 1,280 coming-soon placeholder lessons across six subjects.
-- English and Mathematics: 4 lessons a week, ten four-week units a year (320 each).
-- Science and Technology, HSIE, PDHPE and Creative Arts: 2 lessons a week, eight five-week units a year (160 each).
-- 40 weeks per year. Placeholders are shared lessons (family_id NULL) flagged coming_soon.
-- stage is the full label 'Stage 1' to match the Lessons page. Safe to re-run (INSERT OR IGNORE).
-- Build a lesson by replacing its row's data and removing coming_soon (keep the seed_key or add a topic suffix).
